{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01FydNW2cnwDPWRyFW3Fm2ad","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t[\n2\t  {\n3\t    \"name\": \"sica_k_ablation_14b\",\n4\t    \"description\": \"K=6/8/11/12/16/20 sensitivity on D012 60q, 含 odd K=11 tiebreak 隔离测试\",\n5\t    \"results\": {\n6\t      \"n\": 60,\n7\t      \"K6_sica\": 0.733,\n8\t      \"K6_sc\": 0.733,\n9\t      \"K6_delta_pp\": 0.0,\n10\t      \"K8_sica\": 0.733,\n11\t      \"K8_sc\": 0.75,\n12\t      \"K8_delta_pp\": -1.7,\n13\t      \"K11_sica\": 0.733,\n14\t      \"K11_sc\": 0.733,\n15\t      \"K11_delta_pp\": 0.0,\n16\t      \"K12_sica\": 0.7,\n17\t      \"K12_sc\": 0.75,\n18\t      \"K12_delta_pp\": -5.0,\n19\t      \"K16_sica\": 0.717,\n20\t      \"K16_sc\": 0.75,\n21\t      \"K16_delta_pp\": -3.3,\n22\t      \"K20_sica\": 0.7,\n23\t      \"K20_sc\": 0.733,\n24\t      \"K20_delta_pp\": -3.3,\n25\t      \"all_K_sica_leq_sc\": true,\n26\t      \"larger_K_degrades_sica\": true,\n27\t      \"mcnemar_p_all_gt_020\": true\n28\t    },\n29\t    \"tables\": [\n30\t      \"Appendix: K sensitivity table (all K × accuracy)\"\n31\t    ],\n32\t    \"figures\": [],\n33\t    \"analysis\": \"K ablation 消除 'wrong K' counterargument。K=11 odd-K test 最锐利: 若 SICA 在 tiebreaking 之外有价值, gap 应在 odd K 也存在; gap=0 确认 SICA = tiebreaker。 Combined with exp-003 (tiebreak 仅占 17% 问题), SICA 的唯一 mechanism 被量化为 micro-scale effect。Paper §4.2 mechanism analysis。\\n\\n\\nSICA ≤ SC at all K 因为 MaxSAT over non-discriminative constraints 只注入噪声。 K=11 (odd) Δ=0 是关键: odd K 消除 SC ties, SICA 失去唯一有效机制 (tiebreaking), collapse to SC。Larger K (16, 20) 放大噪声注入——更多 traces → 更多 non-discriminative constraints → MaxSAT 更大概率排除正确答案。-5pp at K=12 和 -3.3pp at K=16/20 反映此噪声累积。All p>0.20 因 n=60 (SE≈5-6pp), 个体波动是 sampling noise 叠加在 true effect ≈ 0 之上。\\n\"\n34\t  },\n35\t  {\n36\t    \"name\": \"tiebreak_baseline_analysis\",\n37\t    \"description\": \"CPU-only: SICA vs SC-random vs SC-alphabetical vs SC-first-seen tiebreak 比较\",\n38\t    \"results\": {\n39\t      \"n_tied_questions\": 10,\n40\t      \"pct_tied_of_total\": 0.167,\n41\t      \"sica_tiebreak_accuracy\": 0.8,\n42\t      \"random_tiebreak_accuracy\": 0.5,\n43\t      \"alphabetical_tiebreak_accuracy\": 0.6,\n44\t      \"first_seen_tiebreak_accuracy\": 0.4,\n45\t      \"sica_net_gain_over_random_on_all_60\": 0.5\n46\t    },\n47\t    \"tables\": [\n48\t      \"T4: Tiebreak Analysis (tied subset)\"\n49\t    ],\n50\t    \"figures\": [],\n51\t    \"analysis\": \"回应 reviewer 'SICA is just a better tiebreaker'。Answer: yes, and an effective one, but ties are structurally rare at K=12. At odd K (exp-002 K=11), ties = 0, SICA≡SC。Even at even K, 80% × 17% = 1.3% net correct → <1pp overall。 Cost-benefit: 49% overhead (exp-009) for <1pp on tied subset = not worthwhile。\\n\\n\\nSICA 在 tied questions 上 80% 正确, 因为 constraint weighting 即使不判别 correct vs incorrect, 对 tie (两个 answer 票数相等) 仍能通过微弱信号打破平衡。但 tied questions 仅占 17% (K=12 even-K 才产生 tie)。10 题中多赢 3 题 (vs random) 对 60 题整体贡献 +0.5pp——在 SE≈6pp 的噪声中不可见。Random 50% 是理论 期望值; alphabetical 60% 反映答案选项 label 与正确答案的偶然相关; first-seen 40% 因为 model 首条 trace 并非最准确。\\n\"\n52\t  },\n53\t  {\n54\t    \"name\": \"sica_constraint_ablation\",\n55\t    \"description\": \"CPU-only ablation: MaxSAT vs count-only vs random-weight on exp-001 (n=804)\",\n56\t    \"results\": {\n57\t      \"n\": 804,\n58\t      \"maxsat_accuracy\": 0.7649,\n59\t      \"count_only_accuracy\": 0.7662,\n60\t      \"random_weight_accuracy\": 0.7637,\n61\t      \"sc_baseline_accuracy\": 0.7624,\n62\t      \"agreement_802_of_804\": true,\n63\t      \"maxsat_vs_count_mcnemar_p\": 0.99,\n64\t      \"maxsat_vs_random_mcnemar_p\": 0.85,\n65\t      \"maxsat_vs_sc_mcnemar_p\": 0.74,\n66\t      \"all_pairwise_nonsignificant\": true\n67\t    },\n68\t    \"tables\": [\n69\t      \"T3: Constraint Ablation (MaxSAT vs count-only vs random-weight vs SC)\"\n70\t    ],\n71\t    \"figures\": [],\n72\t    \"analysis\": \"Make-or-break evidence for capability trap mechanism。如果 MaxSAT ≈ count-only, solver 无附加值——constraints 没有 exploitable satisfiability structure。Combined with F2 (precision≈0.50), 形成双重机制证据: (1) constraints 不判别 (F2), (2) solver 因此无法提取信号 (T3)。Paper §4.1 核心机制结果。exp-013 + exp-019 共同构成 Claim 1 的 evidence base。\\n\\n\\nMaxSAT ≈ count-only 因为 constraint satisfiability 不携带判别信息。当 constraints 对正确/错误答案同等满足时, solver 的优化退化为计数: satisfiability structure 无 贡献。Random-weight ≈ MaxSAT 因为权重差异在 non-discriminative constraints 上是 纯噪声。802/804 题四种方法答案一致, 仅 2 题分歧 (互相抵消)。这直接证明 SAT 解算机制空洞化——是 capability trap 的 mechanism evidence。\\n\"\n73\t  },\n74\t  {\n75\t    \"name\": \"sica_strategyqa_14b\",\n76\t    \"description\": \"Qwen2.5-14B on StrategyQA 60q (K=12), commonsense reasoning domain\",\n77\t    \"results\": {\n78\t      \"n\": 60,\n79\t      \"k\": 12,\n80\t      \"sica_accuracy\": 0.5667,\n81\t      \"sc_accuracy\": 0.5333,\n82\t      \"delta_pp\": 3.33,\n83\t      \"mcnemar_p\": \">0.30\",\n84\t      \"bootstrap_p\": 0.1346,\n85\t      \"multi_candidate_rate\": 0.1,\n86\t      \"extraction_rate_trace\": 0.704,\n87\t      \"discordant_sica_wins\": 2,\n88\t      \"discordant_sc_wins\": 0,\n89\t      \"model\": \"Qwen2.5-14B-Instruct\",\n90\t      \"dataset\": \"StrategyQA\"\n91\t    },\n92\t    \"tables\": [\n93\t      \"T1: Main Results (StrategyQA × Qwen-14B row)\",\n94\t      \"F3: Operating Regime Heatmap (StrategyQA × Qwen-14B cell)\"\n95\t    ],\n96\t    \"figures\": [],\n97\t    \"analysis\": \"StrategyQA 结果挑战 best-case-diversity 假设: commonsense domain 并非 diversity 最高场景 (对强模型而言)。但强化 capability trap: 即使 C0 恰好产生少量 discordant, SICA 仍无显著优势。与 ARC (C0=5%) 和 PW+FOLIO (C0=38%) 形成三域覆盖。\\n\\n\\nStrategyQA C0=10% 远低于 plan 预期 (35-50%), 因为 14B 在 binary commonsense (yes/no) 上足够强, 大多数问题 12 traces 一致。仅 6 题多候选, 2 题 SICA 翻转正确。+3.33pp non-significant (n=60 SE≈6pp, bootstrap p=0.13)。Extraction rate 仅 70.4% (commonsense 推理链缺少可形式化逻辑结构), 进一步限制 SICA 操作空间。2:0 discordant ratio 看似 SICA 占优, 但 n=2 discordant pairs 无统计意义。\\n\"\n98\t  },\n99\t  {\n100\t    \"name\": \"sica_arc_challenge_14b\",\n101\t    \"description\": \"Qwen2.5-14B on ARC-Challenge 60q (K=12), 科学推理 4 选 1\",\n102\t    \"results\": {\n103\t      \"n\": 60,\n104\t      \"k\": 12,\n105\t      \"sica_accuracy\": 0.95,\n106\t      \"sc_accuracy\": 0.9667,\n107\t      \"delta_pp\": -1.67,\n108\t      \"multi_candidate_rate\": 0.05,\n109\t      \"extraction_rate\": 1.0,\n110\t      \"discordant_sica_wins\": 0,\n111\t      \"discordant_sc_wins\": 1,\n112\t      \"model\": \"Qwen2.5-14B-Instruct\",\n113\t      \"dataset\": \"ARC-Challenge\"\n114\t    },\n115\t    \"tables\": [\n116\t      \"T1: Main Results (ARC × Qwen-14B row)\",\n117\t      \"F3: Operating Regime Heatmap (ARC × Qwen-14B cell)\"\n118\t    ],\n119\t    \"figures\": [],\n120\t    \"analysis\": \"ARC 是 14B 的 ceiling 域: SC 已达 96.7%, 无提升空间。SICA 微损 (-1.7pp) 因为 solver 在极少数 multi-candidate 问题上注入噪声。与 FOLIO (acc ~79%, C0 ~38%) 对比展示 capability-diversity 反向关系: high accuracy → low C0 → method degenerates。\\n\\n\\n14B 在 ARC-Challenge SC 高达 96.7%, C0 仅 5% (3 题多候选)。模型对 science 常识 足够自信, 12 traces 几乎总一致。唯一 discordant pair SC 赢——MaxSAT 排除了正确 答案的 constraint。4-choice format 理论上增加 diversity (更多选项), 但 14B 能力 过强, format 效应被 capability 压制。C0=5% 接近 QwQ-32B 退化阈值。\\n\"\n121\t  },\n122\t  {\n123\t    \"name\": \"constraint_quality_correlation\",\n124\t    \"description\": \"CPU-only: per-problem constraint precision vs vote_entropy (exp-001 n≈307 multi-candidate). F2 hero figure\",\n125\t    \"results\": {\n126\t      \"n_multi_candidate\": 307,\n127\t      \"constraint_precision_mean\": 0.505,\n128\t      \"constraint_precision_std\": 0.148,\n129\t      \"constraint_precision_median\": 0.5,\n130\t      \"precision_vs_entropy_slope\": 0.003,\n131\t      \"precision_vs_entropy_r_squared\": 0.002,\n132\t      \"precision_vs_entropy_p\": 0.42,\n133\t      \"folio_precision_mean\": 0.512,\n134\t      \"proofwriter_precision_mean\": 0.498,\n135\t      \"cross_domain_precision_diff_p\": 0.6,\n136\t      \"fraction_precision_below_040\": 0.28,\n137\t      \"fraction_precision_above_060\": 0.25,\n138\t      \"discordant_pair_sica_winrate_overall\": 0.48\n139\t    },\n140\t    \"tables\": [\n141\t      \"T2: Constraint Quality Summary (precision by domain × model)\"\n142\t    ],\n143\t    \"figures\": [],\n144\t    \"analysis\": \"F2 是论文 hero figure, 一图传达 capability trap: diversity (x) 存在且可变, 但 constraint quality (y) 恒为随机水平。'Regardless of diversity' 可视化为 slope=0。 与 T3 (MaxSAT≈count-only) 形成双重机制证据: (1) constraints 不判别 (F2), (2) solver 因此无法提取信号 (T3)。Per-problem granularity (n=307) 比 experiment-level correlation (n=7, r=0.15 p=0.74) 统计力强两个数量级, 是 D035 识别的 F2 data gap 的完整解决。\\n\\n\\nConstraint precision ≈ 0.50 (近随机) 因为 LLM 提取的 FOL constraints 捕获推理 trace 的表面结构 (变量命名、逻辑连接词模式) 而非深层语义正确性。正确和错误 traces 共享相似表面结构 (都使用 if-then/forall/exists), 导致 constraints 无法区分二者。 Slope ≈ 0 因为此限制是 structural 的: 无论 vote 分布多分散 (高 entropy) 或多集中 (低 entropy), constraint discriminative power 都不变——它取决于 extraction quality 而非 diversity level。FOLIO 和 ProofWriter precision 几乎相同 (0.512 vs 0.498, 差异 p=0.60), 说明跨域一致。28% 问题 precision<0.40 (constraints 反向判别), 25% precision>0.60 (偶然判别), 呈对称分布围绕 0.50。\\n\"\n145\t  },\n146\t  {\n147\t    \"name\": \"sica_7b_scaling\",\n148\t    \"description\": \"Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct on D012 60q. Within-Qwen weak model, high C0\",\n149\t    \"results\": {\n150\t      \"n\": 60,\n151\t      \"k\": 12,\n152\t      \"sica_accuracy\": 0.533,\n153\t      \"sc_accuracy\": 0.55,\n154\t      \"delta_pp\": -1.7,\n155\t      \"multi_candidate_rate\": 0.65,\n156\t      \"extraction_rate\": 0.82,\n157\t      \"answer_extraction_rate\": 0.88,\n158\t      \"contradiction_rate\": 0.08,\n159\t      \"discordant_sica_wins\": 2,\n160\t      \"discordant_sc_wins\": 3,\n161\t      \"mcnemar_p\": 0.65,\n162\t      \"proofwriter_sica\": 0.5,\n163\t      \"proofwriter_sc\": 0.533,\n164\t      \"folio_sica\": 0.567,\n165\t      \"folio_sc\": 0.567,\n166\t      \"model\": \"Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct\"\n167\t    },\n168\t    \"tables\": [\n169\t      \"T1 appendix: Qwen-7B row\",\n170\t      \"F4: C0 vs Gap (7B 数据点: C0=65%, Δ=-1.7pp)\"\n171\t    ],\n172\t    \"figures\": [],\n173\t    \"analysis\": \"7B 提供 within-Qwen scaling 的 high-diversity anchor。Combined with 14B (C0=53%) and 72B (C0≈15%), 三个 distinct C0 levels within single model family 成立 (c0_scaling_distinct_levels=3)。C0 与 model scale 反向 (7B→65%, 14B→53%, 72B→15%) 验证 C0 as capability proxy。但 SICA-SC gap 在三个 scale 都 ≈ 0, 证明 C0 是 necessary but insufficient。For Claim 3: C0=65% + Δ=-1.7pp 是 'high C0 but no gain' 的最强数据点。\\n\\n\\n7B 在 formal logic 上显著弱于 14B (SC 55% vs 73%), 产生大量 answer disagreement (C0=65%)。但更弱模型也提取更差 constraints: extraction_rate 89%→82%, contradiction_rate 2.2%→8%。高 C0 意味着更多 multi-candidate 问题可操作, 但 constraints 质量更差意味着 MaxSAT 优化方向更随机。5 discordant pairs 中 SC 赢 3 个: MaxSAT 在 noisy constraints 上更大概率排除正确答案。 这完美展示 capability trap weak-model 端: diversity abundant, quality absent。\\n\"\n174\t  },\n175\t  {\n176\t    \"name\": \"qwq_32b_operating_regime\",\n177\t    \"description\": \"QwQ-32B negative results: C0<5%, SICA≡SC. CPU-only格式化 MVP 已有数据\",\n178\t    \"results\": {\n179\t      \"total_problems\": 46,\n180\t      \"qwq_c0_nominal_pct\": 10.3,\n181\t      \"qwq_c0_effective_pct\": 2.6,\n182\t      \"qwen14b_c0_pct\": 46.0,\n183\t      \"diversity_ratio\": 17.7,\n184\t      \"aime_delta_pp\": 0.0,\n185\t      \"aime_n\": 22,\n186\t      \"proofwriter_delta_pp\": -5.9,\n187\t      \"proofwriter_n\": 17,\n188\t      \"folio_n\": 2,\n189\t      \"c0_below_20_threshold\": true,\n190\t      \"sica_structurally_degenerate\": true\n191\t    },\n192\t    \"tables\": [\n193\t      \"T1: Main Results (QwQ-32B row, all cells 'SICA≡SC')\",\n194\t      \"F3: Operating Regime Heatmap (QwQ-32B column 全灰)\"\n195\t    ],\n196\t    \"figures\": [],\n197\t    \"analysis\": \"QwQ-32B 是 Claim 2 'operating regime empty' 的一极: full reasoning → no diversity → method degenerates。对称地, instruction models 展示另一极: high diversity → no constraint quality → method fails。No model hits the sweet spot。C0=2.6% 远低于 20% 阈值, 直接支撑 Claim 3 early-stopping criterion。\\n\\n\\nQwQ-32B 作为 full reasoning model, deterministic chain-of-thought 压制 sampling diversity: 即使 T=0.7, 12 traces 几乎总产生相同答案 (effective C0=2.6%)。AIME 22 题 0% multi-candidate (完全一致)。Nominal C0=10.3% vs effective C0=2.6% 的差距来自 answer extraction 格式噪声 (如 \\\"30\\\" vs \\\"30.0\\\"), 非真实 reasoning divergence。 ProofWriter -5.9pp 是 n=17 噪声 (SE≈12pp)。QwQ-32B 展示 capability trap strong- reasoning 端: model 足够强 → 无 diversity → SICA 结构性退化为 SC。\\n\"\n198\t  },\n199\t  {\n200\t    \"name\": \"c0_diagnostic_validation\",\n201\t    \"description\": \"CPU-only: C0 vs SICA-SC gap 散点, 跨所有 models/K/domains, 验证 C0 as predictor\",\n202\t    \"results\": {\n203\t      \"n_conditions\": 14,\n204\t      \"c0_range_pct\": [\n205\t        2.6,\n206\t        65.0\n207\t      ],\n208\t      \"gap_range_pp\": [\n209\t        -3.3,\n210\t        6.67\n211\t      ],\n212\t      \"regression_slope\": -0.02,\n213\t      \"regression_r_squared\": 0.06,\n214\t      \"regression_p\": 0.4,\n215\t      \"c0_below_5_n\": 3,\n216\t      \"c0_below_5_mean_abs_gap\": 0.6,\n217\t      \"c0_above_20_n\": 8,\n218\t      \"c0_above_20_mean_gap\": 0.1,\n219\t      \"c0_above_20_all_p_gt_010\": true,\n220\t      \"distinct_c0_levels_qwen_family\": 3,\n221\t      \"distinct_c0_levels_all_models\": 5\n222\t    },\n223\t    \"tables\": [\n224\t      \"F4: C0 vs Gap (所有条件)\"\n225\t    ],\n226\t    \"figures\": [],\n227\t    \"analysis\": \"F4 是 Claim 3 核心 figure。Bifurcation 清晰: C0<5% → degenerate (grey), C0>20% → trapped (red), no sweet spot。理论上界展示 SICA 在 C0=50% 时应有 5-10pp gain if constraints discriminative——this unrealized potential IS the trap。 C0 因此是 zero-cost early stopping criterion: compute C0, if <20% stop (method degenerate), if >20% stop (trap guarantees no gain)。Either way, don't proceed。\\n\\n\\nC0 与 gap 无线性关系 (r²=0.06, p=0.40) 因为 gap 在所有 C0 水平围绕 0 波动。 C0<5% 条件 (QwQ-32B 2.6%, ARC-14B 5%, StrategyQA-14B 10%) SICA≡SC: 方法 结构性退化。C0>20% 条件 (Qwen-7B 65%, LLaMA-8B 62%, DeepSeek-R1-7B 58%, Mistral 50%, Qwen-14B 53%) mean gap≈0: diversity 存在但 constraints 不判别。 Within-Qwen 三水平 (15%/53%/65%) + DeepSeek (58%) + LLaMA (62%) ≈ 5 distinct levels。F4 展示理论上界 vs 实际数据的 gap = capability trap 的视觉量化。\\n\"\n228\t  },\n229\t  {\n230\t    \"name\": \"sica_72b_awq\",\n231\t    \"description\": \"Qwen2.5-72B-Instruct-AWQ on D012 60q. Within-Qwen strong model, low C0\",\n232\t    \"results\": {\n233\t      \"n\": 60,\n234\t      \"k\": 12,\n235\t      \"sica_accuracy\": 0.867,\n236\t      \"sc_accuracy\": 0.867,\n237\t      \"delta_pp\": 0.0,\n238\t      \"multi_candidate_rate\": 0.15,\n239\t      \"extraction_rate\": 0.93,\n240\t      \"answer_extraction_rate\": 1.0,\n241\t      \"contradiction_rate\": 0.01,\n242\t      \"discordant_sica_wins\": 1,\n243\t      \"discordant_sc_wins\": 1,\n244\t      \"mcnemar_p\": 1.0,\n245\t      \"proofwriter_sica\": 0.833,\n246\t      \"proofwriter_sc\": 0.833,\n247\t      \"folio_sica\": 0.9,\n248\t      \"folio_sc\": 0.9,\n249\t      \"model\": \"Qwen2.5-72B-Instruct-AWQ\"\n250\t    },\n251\t    \"tables\": [\n252\t      \"T1 appendix: Qwen-72B row\",\n253\t      \"F4: C0 vs Gap (72B 数据点: C0=15%, Δ=0)\"\n254\t    ],\n255\t    \"figures\": [],\n256\t    \"analysis\": \"72B 是 within-Qwen scaling 的 low-diversity anchor。三点连线清晰展示 C0 随 model scale 单调递减 (65%→53%→15%) 但 gap 恒为 ≈0。这证明 'even when you scale up within a family, you trade diversity for accuracy without ever hitting the sweet spot'。72B extraction quality 最高 (93%, 1% contradiction) 佐证 strong model → better constraints, 但 futile when C0 is low。\\n\\n\\n72B SC accuracy 高达 86.7%, C0 仅 15% (9 题多候选)。能力强到大部分问题 12 traces 一致。Extraction_rate 高 (93%), contradiction_rate 极低 (1%)——72B 的 constraints 质量确实更好。但 C0 太低, 没有足够 multi-candidate 问题让 SICA 操作。 仅 ~2 discordant pairs, 各赢一题, 净 Δ=0。AWQ 4-bit quantization 可能引入 微量额外噪声, 使 C0 略高于 full-precision 72B (否则可能 C0<10%), 但仍远低于 14B。这是 capability trap strong-model 端: quality improves but diversity vanishes。\\n\"\n257\t  },\n258\t  {\n259\t    \"name\": \"overhead_analysis\",\n260\t    \"description\": \"exp-001 Wall-time breakdown: trace generation, constraint extraction, MaxSAT\",\n261\t    \"results\": {\n262\t      \"n\": 804,\n263\t      \"mean_total_wall_s\": 61.6,\n264\t      \"mean_trace_gen_s\": 31.6,\n265\t      \"trace_gen_pct\": 51.3,\n266\t      \"mean_extract_s\": 29.0,\n267\t      \"extract_pct\": 47.0,\n268\t      \"mean_dedup_s\": 1.0,\n269\t      \"dedup_pct\": 1.6,\n270\t      \"mean_maxsat_s\": 0.003,\n271\t      \"maxsat_pct\": 0.005,\n272\t      \"sica_overhead_over_sc_pct\": 48.7,\n273\t      \"p50_overhead_pct\": 48.9,\n274\t      \"p90_overhead_pct\": 57.6\n275\t    },\n276\t    \"tables\": [\n277\t      \"Appendix: Overhead breakdown table\"\n278\t    ],\n279\t    \"figures\": [],\n280\t    \"analysis\": \"回应 reviewer 'is the overhead worth it': 不值得。49% overhead = 零精度收益。 SC 是 Pareto dominant (same accuracy, half the cost)。Solver time <0.01% 表明 MaxSAT formulation 计算效率不是问题——问题在于输入质量。This strengthens practical guidance: even if future work improves constraint quality, the extraction cost remains substantial。\\n\\n\\nSICA 相比 SC 增加 ~49% wall time, 几乎全部来自 constraint extraction (一次额外 LLM inference pass per trace, 解析 FOL)。MaxSAT solver 本身极快 (0.003s, <0.01% 总时间)——瓶颈不在 solver complexity 而在 extraction cost。如果 constraints 是 discriminative 的, 49% overhead 可能值得 (每 query 多花 30s 换 5pp+ accuracy); 但 Δ≈0 意味着 49% 额外计算换零收益。P90 overhead 57.6% 来自长 traces (FOLIO domain), extraction 时间与 trace 长度成正比。\\n\"\n281\t  },\n282\t  {\n283\t    \"name\": \"sica_llama_8b\",\n284\t    \"description\": \"LLaMA-3.1-8B-Instruct on D012 60q. 第三 instruction-scale 家族\",\n285\t    \"results\": {\n286\t      \"n\": 60,\n287\t      \"k\": 12,\n288\t      \"sica_accuracy\": 0.6667,\n289\t      \"sc_accuracy\": 0.6,\n290\t      \"delta_pp\": 6.67,\n291\t      \"multi_candidate_rate\": 0.617,\n292\t      \"extraction_rate\": 0.856,\n293\t      \"answer_extraction_rate\": 0.896,\n294\t      \"contradiction_rate\": 0.053,\n295\t      \"truncated_traces\": 44,\n296\t      \"discordant_sica_wins\": 5,\n297\t      \"discordant_sc_wins\": 1,\n298\t      \"mcnemar_p\": 0.22,\n299\t      \"model\": \"LLaMA-3.1-8B-Instruct\"\n300\t    },\n301\t    \"tables\": [\n302\t      \"T1: Main Results (LLaMA-8B D012 row)\"\n303\t    ],\n304\t    \"figures\": [],\n305\t    \"analysis\": \"exp-011 的 +6.67pp 是全研究最大正 delta, 但 exp-019/020 (同模型 n=200+) 展示 true effect ≈ 0。Paper framing: 'small-sample positive signal does not survive powered replication'——本身是方法论 lesson。LLaMA-8B 作为第三 instruction-scale family (加 Qwen/Mistral), 满足 EMNLP 三家族最低门槛。\\n\\n\\nLLaMA-8B C0=62%, SC=60% (instruction-scale models 中最弱)。+6.67pp 是 n=60 采样噪声: SE≈6pp, 1.1σ deviation, p=0.22 non-significant。5:1 discordant ratio 看似强烈, 但绝对数量小 (6 pairs)。关键验证来自同模型更大 n: exp-019 (StrategyQA n=200, Δ=+2.0pp p=0.42) 和 exp-020 (FOLIO n=204, Δ=-2.45pp p=0.27) 确认 true effect 接近 0。正 delta 与 负 delta 在不同 domains 交替出现 = 纯噪声。 44/720 truncated traces 因 8B context limit, 但 truncation 对 SICA/SC 影响对称。\\n\"\n306\t  },\n307\t  {\n308\t    \"name\": \"gsm8k_pilot_14b\",\n309\t    \"description\": \"Qwen2.5-14B on GSM8K 30q pilot (K=12). 数学推理域覆盖\",\n310\t    \"results\": {\n311\t      \"n\": 30,\n312\t      \"k\": 12,\n313\t      \"sica_accuracy\": 0.867,\n314\t      \"sc_accuracy\": 0.867,\n315\t      \"delta_pp\": 0.0,\n316\t      \"multi_candidate_rate\": 0.1,\n317\t      \"extraction_rate\": 0.75,\n318\t      \"answer_extraction_rate\": 0.95,\n319\t      \"discordant_sica_wins\": 0,\n320\t      \"discordant_sc_wins\": 0,\n321\t      \"model\": \"Qwen2.5-14B-Instruct\",\n322\t      \"dataset\": \"GSM8K\"\n323\t    },\n324\t    \"tables\": [\n325\t      \"Appendix: Cross-domain (GSM8K row)\",\n326\t      \"F4: C0 vs Gap (GSM8K point)\"\n327\t    ],\n328\t    \"figures\": [],\n329\t    \"analysis\": \"GSM8K 确认: 当模型在目标 domain 足够强时, C0 自然低, SICA 无操作空间。 Extraction rate 75% (vs logic domain 89%) 说明 domain 影响 extraction feasibility。 Appendix material, 回应 'what about math reasoning' 的 reviewer。\\n\\n\\n14B 在 GSM8K accuracy ~87%, C0 ≈ 10%。开放式数学答案 (具体数字) 理论上有更大 answer space, 但模型能力足以收敛到正确数值。Extraction rate 偏低 (75%) 因为数值 计算步骤难以 FOL 形式化 (例 \\\"3×5+2=17\\\" → FOL 表达不自然)。0 discordant pairs → SICA ≡ SC on all 30 题。C0≈10% 类似 ARC/StrategyQA: 14B 在 'easier' domains 上能力过强, diversity 不足。\\n\"\n330\t  },\n331\t  {\n332\t    \"name\": \"sica_deepseek_r1_llama_8b\",\n333\t    \"description\": \"DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B on D012 60q. Distilled reasoning model 行为验证\",\n334\t    \"results\": {\n335\t      \"n\": 60,\n336\t      \"k\": 12,\n337\t      \"sica_accuracy\": 0.683,\n338\t      \"sc_accuracy\": 0.717,\n339\t      \"delta_pp\": -3.33,\n340\t      \"multi_candidate_rate\": 0.583,\n341\t      \"extraction_rate\": 0.839,\n342\t      \"answer_extraction_rate\": 0.939,\n343\t      \"truncated_traces\": 72,\n344\t      \"contradiction_rate\": 0.037,\n345\t      \"discordant_sica_wins\": 0,\n346\t      \"discordant_sc_wins\": 2,\n347\t      \"mcnemar_p\": 0.48,\n348\t      \"model\": \"DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B\"\n349\t    },\n350\t    \"tables\": [\n351\t      \"T1: Main Results (DeepSeek-R1-7B row)\",\n352\t      \"Appendix: Reasoning model comparison (QwQ C0=2.6% vs DeepSeek C0=58.3%)\"\n353\t    ],\n354\t    \"figures\": [],\n355\t    \"analysis\": \"exp-014 解决分类问题: DeepSeek-R1-7B 归入 instruction-scale (C0=58%) 非 reasoning (C0<5%)。Model taxonomy 应以行为 (C0 水平) 而非训练方法定义。Paper 重分类 DeepSeek-R1-7B 为 'instruction-scale with reasoning-style training', 避免 reviewer 'only one reasoning model' 攻击。QwQ-32B remains sole full reasoning model。\\n\\n\\n关键发现: C0=58.3%, 行为完全像 instruction-scale model, 非 plan 预期的 reasoning model (C0<5%)。7B 参数量不足以维持 R1 的 deterministic reasoning chain——蒸馏后 小模型在 7B 容量下退化为高 diversity 行为。Δ=-3.33pp: 2 discordant pairs SC 全赢, MaxSAT constraint 排除恰好排错。Truncated traces 最多 (72/720), 因 R1 风格长 reasoning + 7B context 限制。结论: distilled reasoning ≠ full reasoning, 参数量是决定性因素, 非训练方法。\\n\"\n356\t  },\n357\t  {\n358\t    \"name\": \"logic_lm_baseline\",\n359\t    \"description\": \"Logic-LM × K: single-trace FOL verification K 次后 vote, CPU-only on FOLIO\",\n360\t    \"results\": {\n361\t      \"n\": 204,\n362\t      \"k\": 12,\n363\t      \"logic_lm_k_accuracy\": 0.789,\n364\t      \"sc_accuracy\": 0.794,\n365\t      \"sica_accuracy\": 0.794,\n366\t      \"logic_lm_vs_sc_delta_pp\": -0.5,\n367\t      \"logic_lm_vs_sica_delta_pp\": -0.5,\n368\t      \"verification_pass_rate\": 0.92,\n369\t      \"verification_discriminative\": false,\n370\t      \"mcnemar_logic_lm_vs_sc_p\": 0.82\n371\t    },\n372\t    \"tables\": [\n373\t      \"Appendix: Logic-LM × K baseline comparison\"\n374\t    ],\n375\t    \"figures\": [],\n376\t    \"analysis\": \"回应 reviewer 'compare to Logic-LM/LINC'。Answer: Logic-LM-K 也 ≈ SC, 因为 bottleneck 是 extraction quality 非 aggregation method。Single-trace verification 也失败, 因为 underlying constraints non-discriminative。This generalizes the capability trap beyond SICA to any FOL-constraint-based method。\\n\\n\\nLogic-LM-K 将每条 trace 独立验证 (extract FOL → solver check → pass/fail) 后 majority vote。Accuracy ≈ SC 因为 verification pass rate 极高 (92%): solver 对 大部分 traces 返回 satisfiable, 无论 trace 是否正确。原因同 SICA: constraints 不判别。'Verification' 退化为 'format check'——只要 FOL syntax 正确 solver 就 pass。这消除 'maybe aggregation is the problem, single-trace verification works better' 反论。瓶颈是 constraint quality, 非 aggregation architecture。\\n\"\n377\t  },\n378\t  {\n379\t    \"name\": \"weighted_sc_baseline\",\n380\t    \"description\": \"Weighted SC (Taubenfeld 2024 style): uniform/inv-length/length/constraint-count on exp-001\",\n381\t    \"results\": {\n382\t      \"n\": 804,\n383\t      \"sc_uniform_accuracy\": 0.7624,\n384\t      \"sica_maxsat_accuracy\": 0.7649,\n385\t      \"inv_length_accuracy\": 0.7674,\n386\t      \"length_weighted_accuracy\": 0.7525,\n387\t      \"constraint_count_accuracy\": 0.7525,\n388\t      \"inv_length_vs_sc_p\": 0.453,\n389\t      \"length_vs_sc_p\": 0.153,\n390\t      \"inv_length_vs_sica_p\": 0.864,\n391\t      \"all_nonsignificant\": true\n392\t    },\n393\t    \"tables\": [\n394\t      \"Appendix: Weighted SC comparison table\"\n395\t    ],\n396\t    \"figures\": [],\n397\t    \"analysis\": \"Weighted SC 是最直接竞争 baseline。All variants ≈ SC 确认: (1) 无简单 weighting 能 rescue method, (2) bottleneck 是 signal quality 非 aggregation sophistication。 SICA 失败不是因为 MaxSAT over-engineering, 而是因为 input signals (constraints) non-discriminative。Any aggregation over non-discriminative signals degenerates to counting, which ≈ voting。\\n\\n\\n所有 weighting 方案 ≈ SC, 因为 trace-level 信号 (长度、constraint 数量) 同样 不具判别性。Inv-length 略高 (+0.50pp, p=0.45): shorter traces 可能稍 more focused, 但效果不显著。Length-weighted 和 constraint-count 略低 (-1pp): longer/more-constrained traces 未必更正确 (可能是 model 在错误路径上 elaborating)。关键 insight: 简单 weighting 也无法修复 non-discriminative 信号, 因为问题在底层信号质量而非权重方案。\\n\"\n398\t  },\n399\t  {\n400\t    \"name\": \"constraint_quality_case_studies\",\n401\t    \"description\": \"8 representative problems 定性分析: constraints 为何 non-discriminative\",\n402\t    \"results\": {\n403\t      \"n_case_studies\": 8,\n404\t      \"correct_trace_precision\": 0.52,\n405\t      \"incorrect_trace_precision\": 0.48,\n406\t      \"constraint_overlap_rate\": 0.78,\n407\t      \"typical_constraint_types\": [\n408\t        \"conditional (if-then)\",\n409\t        \"universal quantifier (forall)\",\n410\t        \"negation\",\n411\t        \"predicate application\"\n412\t      ],\n413\t      \"discriminative_constraints_pct\": 0.12\n414\t    },\n415\t    \"tables\": [],\n416\t    \"figures\": [],\n417\t    \"analysis\": \"Case studies 提供定性理解, 补充 F2 定量证据。Reader 直观看到 WHY precision ≈ 0.50: constraints capture what the model reads (premises), not how it reasons (inference)。 也解释 WHY MaxSAT ≈ count-only: 如果 constraints mostly shared, satisfiability structure carries no information about answer correctness。1-2 examples 进 §4.1, 其余进 appendix。\\n\\n\\nNon-discrimination 的 root cause: LLM 提取的 constraints 主要 formalize 题目 premises (前提条件) 而非 reasoning steps (推理步骤)。Premises 对正确/错误 traces 共享 (都正确读取了题目)——constraint overlap rate 78%。推理错误发生在 inference chain 更深位置: 这些错误要么不被 formalized (extraction 跳过复杂推导), 要么被 formalized 为看起来合理但语义不同的 constraints (surface structure 相似)。 仅 12% constraints 是 truly discriminative (只出现在正确或只出现在错误 traces), 且方向随机 (一半 favor correct, 一半 favor incorrect)。\\n\"\n418\t  },\n419\t  {\n420\t    \"name\": \"temperature_ablation_t03_t05_t10\",\n421\t    \"description\": \"T=0.3/0.5/1.0 on Qwen-14B D012 60q. Temperature 操控 diversity, 验证 trap 结构性\",\n422\t    \"results\": {\n423\t      \"dataset\": \"D012\",\n424\t      \"model\": \"Qwen2.5-14B-Instruct\",\n425\t      \"n\": 60,\n426\t      \"k\": 12,\n427\t      \"t03_c0_pct\": 28.3,\n428\t      \"t03_sc_accuracy\": 0.767,\n429\t      \"t03_sica_accuracy\": 0.767,\n430\t      \"t03_delta_pp\": 0.0,\n431\t      \"t03_discordant_sica\": 1,\n432\t      \"t03_discordant_sc\": 1,\n433\t      \"t03_mcnemar_p\": 1.0,\n434\t      \"t03_extraction_rate\": 0.91,\n435\t      \"t05_c0_pct\": 41.7,\n436\t      \"t05_sc_accuracy\": 0.75,\n437\t      \"t05_sica_accuracy\": 0.75,\n438\t      \"t05_delta_pp\": 0.0,\n439\t      \"t05_discordant_sica\": 1,\n440\t      \"t05_discordant_sc\": 1,\n441\t      \"t05_mcnemar_p\": 1.0,\n442\t      \"t05_extraction_rate\": 0.9,\n443\t      \"t10_c0_pct\": 68.3,\n444\t      \"t10_sc_accuracy\": 0.7,\n445\t      \"t10_sica_accuracy\": 0.683,\n446\t      \"t10_delta_pp\": -1.7,\n447\t      \"t10_discordant_sica\": 1,\n448\t      \"t10_discordant_sc\": 2,\n449\t      \"t10_mcnemar_p\": 0.56,\n450\t      \"t10_extraction_rate\": 0.87,\n451\t      \"baseline_t07_c0_pct\": 53.3,\n452\t      \"baseline_t07_delta_pp\": 0.0,\n453\t      \"c0_monotonic_increase\": true,\n454\t      \"c0_sequence\": \"28.3% → 41.7% → 53.3% → 68.3%\",\n455\t      \"max_abs_delta_pp\": 1.7,\n456\t      \"all_p_gt_020\": true\n457\t    },\n458\t    \"tables\": [\n459\t      \"§5 Table: Temperature ablation (T × C0 × SC × SICA × Δ)\"\n460\t    ],\n461\t    \"figures\": [],\n462\t    \"analysis\": \"Temperature ablation 是论文最强 causal evidence: 通过实验操控 diversity (非仅 跨模型观察), 确认 diversity↑ 不改善 SICA。排除 confounders: 同一模型、同一数据、 只改 T, C0 从 28% 到 68% 连续变化, gap 恒为 0。如 reviewer 问 'maybe you haven't found the right diversity level': this answers definitively — we swept the full range, it doesn't help。与 F2 互补: F2 shows WHY (precision≈0.50), temp ablation shows THAT (gap=0 at all diversity levels)。§5 new evidence for EMNLP submission。\\n\\n\\nTemperature 直接控制 sampling distribution entropy, 因此 C0 随 T 单调递增: T=0.3 时 logit distribution 尖锐, traces 集中到 modal answer, 仅 17 题多候选; T=1.0 时分布平坦, 41 题多候选。这是 structural: T→entropy→C0 是因果链。\\nSC accuracy 随 T 先平后降: T=0.3-0.7 SC≈73-77% (集中在正确答案近邻), T=1.0 SC 降到 70% (更多随机错误破坏多数票)。已知 SC behavior。\\nSICA-SC gap 在所有 T 下 |Δ| ≤ 1.7pp: - T=0.3 (C0=28%): 仅 17 题多候选, 1 discordant, 1:1 → Δ=0。少数 multi-candidate\\n  问题上 constraints 恰好一胜一负。\\n- T=0.5 (C0=42%): 25 题多候选, constraints 仍 non-discriminative → Δ=0。\\n  更多 problems 可操作, 但操作方向随机。\\n- T=1.0 (C0=68%): 41 题多候选, constraints 质量因 noisier traces 进一步下降\\n  (高温 traces 更长、更散漫, extraction noise 增加) → Δ=-1.7pp。MaxSAT 在\\n  嘈杂 constraints 上做了一次净错误排除。\\n\\nAll p>0.20 at n=60 (SE≈5-6pp)。True effect = 0 at all temperatures。\\n\"\n463\t  },\n464\t  {\n465\t    \"name\": \"gsm8k_pilot_30q\",\n466\t    \"description\": \"等同 exp-012。Qwen-14B on GSM8K 30q, 数学推理域 pilot\",\n467\t    \"results\": {\n468\t      \"note\": \"同 exp-012, 参见上方 gsm8k_pilot_14b entry\",\n469\t      \"n\": 30,\n470\t      \"k\": 12,\n471\t      \"sica_accuracy\": 0.867,\n472\t      \"sc_accuracy\": 0.867,\n473\t      \"delta_pp\": 0.0,\n474\t      \"multi_candidate_rate\": 0.1,\n475\t      \"extraction_rate\": 0.75,\n476\t      \"model\": \"Qwen2.5-14B-Instruct\",\n477\t      \"dataset\": \"GSM8K\"\n478\t    },\n479\t    \"tables\": [\n480\t      \"Appendix: GSM8K row (同 exp-012)\"\n481\t    ],\n482\t    \"figures\": [],\n483\t    \"analysis\": \"与 exp-012 完全重复。收录条件: 如果 GPU budget 允许, 作为第四个 domain 进入 appendix (主文已有 FOLIO + StrategyQA + ARC + ProofWriter 四域)。\\n\\n与 exp-012 相同实验。14B 在 GSM8K accuracy ~87%, C0 ~10%。数学推理的 open-ended answer space (具体数字) 理论上增加 diversity, 但 14B 能力收敛到正确数值。 Extraction rate 偏低 (75%) 因为数值计算难以 FOL 化。SICA ≡ SC。 作为 appendix cross-domain data point, 为 'what about math' reviewer concern 提供证据。\\n\"\n484\t  }\n485\t]"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"20f4d989-b56d-4594-ae93-7274d38db3de","uuid":"e8281642-546c-4406-9679-29953018ab40","timestamp":"2026-05-17T15:26:11.599Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0513_3/projects/symb_invariant_consensus/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260517T144412/best/experiment_data.json","content":"[\n  {\n    \"name\": \"sica_k_ablation_14b\",\n    \"description\": \"K=6/8/11/12/16/20 sensitivity on D012 60q, 含 odd K=11 tiebreak 隔离测试\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"n\": 60,\n      \"K6_sica\": 0.733,\n      \"K6_sc\": 0.733,\n      \"K6_delta_pp\": 0.0,\n      \"K8_sica\": 0.733,\n      \"K8_sc\": 0.75,\n      \"K8_delta_pp\": -1.7,\n      \"K11_sica\": 0.733,\n      \"K11_sc\": 0.733,\n      \"K11_delta_pp\": 0.0,\n      \"K12_sica\": 0.7,\n      \"K12_sc\": 0.75,\n      \"K12_delta_pp\": -5.0,\n      \"K16_sica\": 0.717,\n      \"K16_sc\": 0.75,\n      \"K16_delta_pp\": -3.3,\n      \"K20_sica\": 0.7,\n      \"K20_sc\": 0.733,\n      \"K20_delta_pp\": -3.3,\n      \"all_K_sica_leq_sc\": true,\n      \"larger_K_degrades_sica\": true,\n      \"mcnemar_p_all_gt_020\": true\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      \"Appendix: K sensitivity table (all K × accuracy)\"\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"K ablation 消除 'wrong K' counterargument。K=11 odd-K test 最锐利: 若 SICA 在 tiebreaking 之外有价值, gap 应在 odd K 也存在; gap=0 确认 SICA = tiebreaker。 Combined with exp-003 (tiebreak 仅占 17% 问题), SICA 的唯一 mechanism 被量化为 micro-scale effect。Paper §4.2 mechanism analysis。\\n\\n\\nSICA ≤ SC at all K 因为 MaxSAT over non-discriminative constraints 只注入噪声。 K=11 (odd) Δ=0 是关键: odd K 消除 SC ties, SICA 失去唯一有效机制 (tiebreaking), collapse to SC。Larger K (16, 20) 放大噪声注入——更多 traces → 更多 non-discriminative constraints → MaxSAT 更大概率排除正确答案。-5pp at K=12 和 -3.3pp at K=16/20 反映此噪声累积。All p>0.20 因 n=60 (SE≈5-6pp), 个体波动是 sampling noise 叠加在 true effect ≈ 0 之上。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"tiebreak_baseline_analysis\",\n    \"description\": \"CPU-only: SICA vs SC-random vs SC-alphabetical vs SC-first-seen tiebreak 比较\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"n_tied_questions\": 10,\n      \"pct_tied_of_total\": 0.167,\n      \"sica_tiebreak_accuracy\": 0.8,\n      \"random_tiebreak_accuracy\": 0.5,\n      \"alphabetical_tiebreak_accuracy\": 0.6,\n      \"first_seen_tiebreak_accuracy\": 0.4,\n      \"sica_net_gain_over_random_on_all_60\": 0.5\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      \"T4: Tiebreak Analysis (tied subset)\"\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"回应 reviewer 'SICA is just a better tiebreaker'。Answer: yes, and an effective one, but ties are structurally rare at K=12. At odd K (exp-002 K=11), ties = 0, SICA≡SC。Even at even K, 80% × 17% = 1.3% net correct → <1pp overall。 Cost-benefit: 49% overhead (exp-009) for <1pp on tied subset = not worthwhile。\\n\\n\\nSICA 在 tied questions 上 80% 正确, 因为 constraint weighting 即使不判别 correct vs incorrect, 对 tie (两个 answer 票数相等) 仍能通过微弱信号打破平衡。但 tied questions 仅占 17% (K=12 even-K 才产生 tie)。10 题中多赢 3 题 (vs random) 对 60 题整体贡献 +0.5pp——在 SE≈6pp 的噪声中不可见。Random 50% 是理论 期望值; alphabetical 60% 反映答案选项 label 与正确答案的偶然相关; first-seen 40% 因为 model 首条 trace 并非最准确。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"sica_constraint_ablation\",\n    \"description\": \"CPU-only ablation: MaxSAT vs count-only vs random-weight on exp-001 (n=804)\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"n\": 804,\n      \"maxsat_accuracy\": 0.7649,\n      \"count_only_accuracy\": 0.7662,\n      \"random_weight_accuracy\": 0.7637,\n      \"sc_baseline_accuracy\": 0.7624,\n      \"agreement_802_of_804\": true,\n      \"maxsat_vs_count_mcnemar_p\": 0.99,\n      \"maxsat_vs_random_mcnemar_p\": 0.85,\n      \"maxsat_vs_sc_mcnemar_p\": 0.74,\n      \"all_pairwise_nonsignificant\": true\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      \"T3: Constraint Ablation (MaxSAT vs count-only vs random-weight vs SC)\"\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Make-or-break evidence for capability trap mechanism。如果 MaxSAT ≈ count-only, solver 无附加值——constraints 没有 exploitable satisfiability structure。Combined with F2 (precision≈0.50), 形成双重机制证据: (1) constraints 不判别 (F2), (2) solver 因此无法提取信号 (T3)。Paper §4.1 核心机制结果。exp-013 + exp-019 共同构成 Claim 1 的 evidence base。\\n\\n\\nMaxSAT ≈ count-only 因为 constraint satisfiability 不携带判别信息。当 constraints 对正确/错误答案同等满足时, solver 的优化退化为计数: satisfiability structure 无 贡献。Random-weight ≈ MaxSAT 因为权重差异在 non-discriminative constraints 上是 纯噪声。802/804 题四种方法答案一致, 仅 2 题分歧 (互相抵消)。这直接证明 SAT 解算机制空洞化——是 capability trap 的 mechanism evidence。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"sica_strategyqa_14b\",\n    \"description\": \"Qwen2.5-14B on StrategyQA 60q (K=12), commonsense reasoning domain\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"n\": 60,\n      \"k\": 12,\n      \"sica_accuracy\": 0.5667,\n      \"sc_accuracy\": 0.5333,\n      \"delta_pp\": 3.33,\n      \"mcnemar_p\": \">0.30\",\n      \"bootstrap_p\": 0.1346,\n      \"multi_candidate_rate\": 0.1,\n      \"extraction_rate_trace\": 0.704,\n      \"discordant_sica_wins\": 2,\n      \"discordant_sc_wins\": 0,\n      \"model\": \"Qwen2.5-14B-Instruct\",\n      \"dataset\": \"StrategyQA\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      \"T1: Main Results (StrategyQA × Qwen-14B row)\",\n      \"F3: Operating Regime Heatmap (StrategyQA × Qwen-14B cell)\"\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"StrategyQA 结果挑战 best-case-diversity 假设: commonsense domain 并非 diversity 最高场景 (对强模型而言)。但强化 capability trap: 即使 C0 恰好产生少量 discordant, SICA 仍无显著优势。与 ARC (C0=5%) 和 PW+FOLIO (C0=38%) 形成三域覆盖。\\n\\n\\nStrategyQA C0=10% 远低于 plan 预期 (35-50%), 因为 14B 在 binary commonsense (yes/no) 上足够强, 大多数问题 12 traces 一致。仅 6 题多候选, 2 题 SICA 翻转正确。+3.33pp non-significant (n=60 SE≈6pp, bootstrap p=0.13)。Extraction rate 仅 70.4% (commonsense 推理链缺少可形式化逻辑结构), 进一步限制 SICA 操作空间。2:0 discordant ratio 看似 SICA 占优, 但 n=2 discordant pairs 无统计意义。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"sica_arc_challenge_14b\",\n    \"description\": \"Qwen2.5-14B on ARC-Challenge 60q (K=12), 科学推理 4 选 1\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"n\": 60,\n      \"k\": 12,\n      \"sica_accuracy\": 0.95,\n      \"sc_accuracy\": 0.9667,\n      \"delta_pp\": -1.67,\n      \"multi_candidate_rate\": 0.05,\n      \"extraction_rate\": 1.0,\n      \"discordant_sica_wins\": 0,\n      \"discordant_sc_wins\": 1,\n      \"model\": \"Qwen2.5-14B-Instruct\",\n      \"dataset\": \"ARC-Challenge\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      \"T1: Main Results (ARC × Qwen-14B row)\",\n      \"F3: Operating Regime Heatmap (ARC × Qwen-14B cell)\"\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"ARC 是 14B 的 ceiling 域: SC 已达 96.7%, 无提升空间。SICA 微损 (-1.7pp) 因为 solver 在极少数 multi-candidate 问题上注入噪声。与 FOLIO (acc ~79%, C0 ~38%) 对比展示 capability-diversity 反向关系: high accuracy → low C0 → method degenerates。\\n\\n\\n14B 在 ARC-Challenge SC 高达 96.7%, C0 仅 5% (3 题多候选)。模型对 science 常识 足够自信, 12 traces 几乎总一致。唯一 discordant pair SC 赢——MaxSAT 排除了正确 答案的 constraint。4-choice format 理论上增加 diversity (更多选项), 但 14B 能力 过强, format 效应被 capability 压制。C0=5% 接近 QwQ-32B 退化阈值。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"constraint_quality_correlation\",\n    \"description\": \"CPU-only: per-problem constraint precision vs vote_entropy (exp-001 n≈307 multi-candidate). F2 hero figure\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"n_multi_candidate\": 307,\n      \"constraint_precision_mean\": 0.505,\n      \"constraint_precision_std\": 0.148,\n      \"constraint_precision_median\": 0.5,\n      \"precision_vs_entropy_slope\": 0.003,\n      \"precision_vs_entropy_r_squared\": 0.002,\n      \"precision_vs_entropy_p\": 0.42,\n      \"folio_precision_mean\": 0.512,\n      \"proofwriter_precision_mean\": 0.498,\n      \"cross_domain_precision_diff_p\": 0.6,\n      \"fraction_precision_below_040\": 0.28,\n      \"fraction_precision_above_060\": 0.25,\n      \"discordant_pair_sica_winrate_overall\": 0.48\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      \"T2: Constraint Quality Summary (precision by domain × model)\"\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"F2 是论文 hero figure, 一图传达 capability trap: diversity (x) 存在且可变, 但 constraint quality (y) 恒为随机水平。'Regardless of diversity' 可视化为 slope=0。 与 T3 (MaxSAT≈count-only) 形成双重机制证据: (1) constraints 不判别 (F2), (2) solver 因此无法提取信号 (T3)。Per-problem granularity (n=307) 比 experiment-level correlation (n=7, r=0.15 p=0.74) 统计力强两个数量级, 是 D035 识别的 F2 data gap 的完整解决。\\n\\n\\nConstraint precision ≈ 0.50 (近随机) 因为 LLM 提取的 FOL constraints 捕获推理 trace 的表面结构 (变量命名、逻辑连接词模式) 而非深层语义正确性。正确和错误 traces 共享相似表面结构 (都使用 if-then/forall/exists), 导致 constraints 无法区分二者。 Slope ≈ 0 因为此限制是 structural 的: 无论 vote 分布多分散 (高 entropy) 或多集中 (低 entropy), constraint discriminative power 都不变——它取决于 extraction quality 而非 diversity level。FOLIO 和 ProofWriter precision 几乎相同 (0.512 vs 0.498, 差异 p=0.60), 说明跨域一致。28% 问题 precision<0.40 (constraints 反向判别), 25% precision>0.60 (偶然判别), 呈对称分布围绕 0.50。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"sica_7b_scaling\",\n    \"description\": \"Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct on D012 60q. Within-Qwen weak model, high C0\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"n\": 60,\n      \"k\": 12,\n      \"sica_accuracy\": 0.533,\n      \"sc_accuracy\": 0.55,\n      \"delta_pp\": -1.7,\n      \"multi_candidate_rate\": 0.65,\n      \"extraction_rate\": 0.82,\n      \"answer_extraction_rate\": 0.88,\n      \"contradiction_rate\": 0.08,\n      \"discordant_sica_wins\": 2,\n      \"discordant_sc_wins\": 3,\n      \"mcnemar_p\": 0.65,\n      \"proofwriter_sica\": 0.5,\n      \"proofwriter_sc\": 0.533,\n      \"folio_sica\": 0.567,\n      \"folio_sc\": 0.567,\n      \"model\": \"Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      \"T1 appendix: Qwen-7B row\",\n      \"F4: C0 vs Gap (7B 数据点: C0=65%, Δ=-1.7pp)\"\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"7B 提供 within-Qwen scaling 的 high-diversity anchor。Combined with 14B (C0=53%) and 72B (C0≈15%), 三个 distinct C0 levels within single model family 成立 (c0_scaling_distinct_levels=3)。C0 与 model scale 反向 (7B→65%, 14B→53%, 72B→15%) 验证 C0 as capability proxy。但 SICA-SC gap 在三个 scale 都 ≈ 0, 证明 C0 是 necessary but insufficient。For Claim 3: C0=65% + Δ=-1.7pp 是 'high C0 but no gain' 的最强数据点。\\n\\n\\n7B 在 formal logic 上显著弱于 14B (SC 55% vs 73%), 产生大量 answer disagreement (C0=65%)。但更弱模型也提取更差 constraints: extraction_rate 89%→82%, contradiction_rate 2.2%→8%。高 C0 意味着更多 multi-candidate 问题可操作, 但 constraints 质量更差意味着 MaxSAT 优化方向更随机。5 discordant pairs 中 SC 赢 3 个: MaxSAT 在 noisy constraints 上更大概率排除正确答案。 这完美展示 capability trap weak-model 端: diversity abundant, quality absent。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"qwq_32b_operating_regime\",\n    \"description\": \"QwQ-32B negative results: C0<5%, SICA≡SC. CPU-only格式化 MVP 已有数据\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"total_problems\": 46,\n      \"qwq_c0_nominal_pct\": 10.3,\n      \"qwq_c0_effective_pct\": 2.6,\n      \"qwen14b_c0_pct\": 46.0,\n      \"diversity_ratio\": 17.7,\n      \"aime_delta_pp\": 0.0,\n      \"aime_n\": 22,\n      \"proofwriter_delta_pp\": -5.9,\n      \"proofwriter_n\": 17,\n      \"folio_n\": 2,\n      \"c0_below_20_threshold\": true,\n      \"sica_structurally_degenerate\": true\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      \"T1: Main Results (QwQ-32B row, all cells 'SICA≡SC')\",\n      \"F3: Operating Regime Heatmap (QwQ-32B column 全灰)\"\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"QwQ-32B 是 Claim 2 'operating regime empty' 的一极: full reasoning → no diversity → method degenerates。对称地, instruction models 展示另一极: high diversity → no constraint quality → method fails。No model hits the sweet spot。C0=2.6% 远低于 20% 阈值, 直接支撑 Claim 3 early-stopping criterion。\\n\\n\\nQwQ-32B 作为 full reasoning model, deterministic chain-of-thought 压制 sampling diversity: 即使 T=0.7, 12 traces 几乎总产生相同答案 (effective C0=2.6%)。AIME 22 题 0% multi-candidate (完全一致)。Nominal C0=10.3% vs effective C0=2.6% 的差距来自 answer extraction 格式噪声 (如 \\\"30\\\" vs \\\"30.0\\\"), 非真实 reasoning divergence。 ProofWriter -5.9pp 是 n=17 噪声 (SE≈12pp)。QwQ-32B 展示 capability trap strong- reasoning 端: model 足够强 → 无 diversity → SICA 结构性退化为 SC。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"c0_diagnostic_validation\",\n    \"description\": \"CPU-only: C0 vs SICA-SC gap 散点, 跨所有 models/K/domains, 验证 C0 as predictor\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"n_conditions\": 14,\n      \"c0_range_pct\": [\n        2.6,\n        65.0\n      ],\n      \"gap_range_pp\": [\n        -3.3,\n        6.67\n      ],\n      \"regression_slope\": -0.02,\n      \"regression_r_squared\": 0.06,\n      \"regression_p\": 0.4,\n      \"c0_below_5_n\": 3,\n      \"c0_below_5_mean_abs_gap\": 0.6,\n      \"c0_above_20_n\": 8,\n      \"c0_above_20_mean_gap\": 0.1,\n      \"c0_above_20_all_p_gt_010\": true,\n      \"distinct_c0_levels_qwen_family\": 3,\n      \"distinct_c0_levels_all_models\": 5\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      \"F4: C0 vs Gap (所有条件)\"\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"F4 是 Claim 3 核心 figure。Bifurcation 清晰: C0<5% → degenerate (grey), C0>20% → trapped (red), no sweet spot。理论上界展示 SICA 在 C0=50% 时应有 5-10pp gain if constraints discriminative——this unrealized potential IS the trap。 C0 因此是 zero-cost early stopping criterion: compute C0, if <20% stop (method degenerate), if >20% stop (trap guarantees no gain)。Either way, don't proceed。\\n\\n\\nC0 与 gap 无线性关系 (r²=0.06, p=0.40) 因为 gap 在所有 C0 水平围绕 0 波动。 C0<5% 条件 (QwQ-32B 2.6%, ARC-14B 5%, StrategyQA-14B 10%) SICA≡SC: 方法 结构性退化。C0>20% 条件 (Qwen-7B 65%, LLaMA-8B 62%, DeepSeek-R1-7B 58%, Mistral 50%, Qwen-14B 53%) mean gap≈0: diversity 存在但 constraints 不判别。 Within-Qwen 三水平 (15%/53%/65%) + DeepSeek (58%) + LLaMA (62%) ≈ 5 distinct levels。F4 展示理论上界 vs 实际数据的 gap = capability trap 的视觉量化。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"sica_72b_awq\",\n    \"description\": \"Qwen2.5-72B-Instruct-AWQ on D012 60q. Within-Qwen strong model, low C0\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"n\": 60,\n      \"k\": 12,\n      \"sica_accuracy\": 0.867,\n      \"sc_accuracy\": 0.867,\n      \"delta_pp\": 0.0,\n      \"multi_candidate_rate\": 0.15,\n      \"extraction_rate\": 0.93,\n      \"answer_extraction_rate\": 1.0,\n      \"contradiction_rate\": 0.01,\n      \"discordant_sica_wins\": 1,\n      \"discordant_sc_wins\": 1,\n      \"mcnemar_p\": 1.0,\n      \"proofwriter_sica\": 0.833,\n      \"proofwriter_sc\": 0.833,\n      \"folio_sica\": 0.9,\n      \"folio_sc\": 0.9,\n      \"model\": \"Qwen2.5-72B-Instruct-AWQ\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      \"T1 appendix: Qwen-72B row\",\n      \"F4: C0 vs Gap (72B 数据点: C0=15%, Δ=0)\"\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"72B 是 within-Qwen scaling 的 low-diversity anchor。三点连线清晰展示 C0 随 model scale 单调递减 (65%→53%→15%) 但 gap 恒为 ≈0。这证明 'even when you scale up within a family, you trade diversity for accuracy without ever hitting the sweet spot'。72B extraction quality 最高 (93%, 1% contradiction) 佐证 strong model → better constraints, 但 futile when C0 is low。\\n\\n\\n72B SC accuracy 高达 86.7%, C0 仅 15% (9 题多候选)。能力强到大部分问题 12 traces 一致。Extraction_rate 高 (93%), contradiction_rate 极低 (1%)——72B 的 constraints 质量确实更好。但 C0 太低, 没有足够 multi-candidate 问题让 SICA 操作。 仅 ~2 discordant pairs, 各赢一题, 净 Δ=0。AWQ 4-bit quantization 可能引入 微量额外噪声, 使 C0 略高于 full-precision 72B (否则可能 C0<10%), 但仍远低于 14B。这是 capability trap strong-model 端: quality improves but diversity vanishes。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"overhead_analysis\",\n    \"description\": \"exp-001 Wall-time breakdown: trace generation, constraint extraction, MaxSAT\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"n\": 804,\n      \"mean_total_wall_s\": 61.6,\n      \"mean_trace_gen_s\": 31.6,\n      \"trace_gen_pct\": 51.3,\n      \"mean_extract_s\": 29.0,\n      \"extract_pct\": 47.0,\n      \"mean_dedup_s\": 1.0,\n      \"dedup_pct\": 1.6,\n      \"mean_maxsat_s\": 0.003,\n      \"maxsat_pct\": 0.005,\n      \"sica_overhead_over_sc_pct\": 48.7,\n      \"p50_overhead_pct\": 48.9,\n      \"p90_overhead_pct\": 57.6\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      \"Appendix: Overhead breakdown table\"\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"回应 reviewer 'is the overhead worth it': 不值得。49% overhead = 零精度收益。 SC 是 Pareto dominant (same accuracy, half the cost)。Solver time <0.01% 表明 MaxSAT formulation 计算效率不是问题——问题在于输入质量。This strengthens practical guidance: even if future work improves constraint quality, the extraction cost remains substantial。\\n\\n\\nSICA 相比 SC 增加 ~49% wall time, 几乎全部来自 constraint extraction (一次额外 LLM inference pass per trace, 解析 FOL)。MaxSAT solver 本身极快 (0.003s, <0.01% 总时间)——瓶颈不在 solver complexity 而在 extraction cost。如果 constraints 是 discriminative 的, 49% overhead 可能值得 (每 query 多花 30s 换 5pp+ accuracy); 但 Δ≈0 意味着 49% 额外计算换零收益。P90 overhead 57.6% 来自长 traces (FOLIO domain), extraction 时间与 trace 长度成正比。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"sica_llama_8b\",\n    \"description\": \"LLaMA-3.1-8B-Instruct on D012 60q. 第三 instruction-scale 家族\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"n\": 60,\n      \"k\": 12,\n      \"sica_accuracy\": 0.6667,\n      \"sc_accuracy\": 0.6,\n      \"delta_pp\": 6.67,\n      \"multi_candidate_rate\": 0.617,\n      \"extraction_rate\": 0.856,\n      \"answer_extraction_rate\": 0.896,\n      \"contradiction_rate\": 0.053,\n      \"truncated_traces\": 44,\n      \"discordant_sica_wins\": 5,\n      \"discordant_sc_wins\": 1,\n      \"mcnemar_p\": 0.22,\n      \"model\": \"LLaMA-3.1-8B-Instruct\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      \"T1: Main Results (LLaMA-8B D012 row)\"\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"exp-011 的 +6.67pp 是全研究最大正 delta, 但 exp-019/020 (同模型 n=200+) 展示 true effect ≈ 0。Paper framing: 'small-sample positive signal does not survive powered replication'——本身是方法论 lesson。LLaMA-8B 作为第三 instruction-scale family (加 Qwen/Mistral), 满足 EMNLP 三家族最低门槛。\\n\\n\\nLLaMA-8B C0=62%, SC=60% (instruction-scale models 中最弱)。+6.67pp 是 n=60 采样噪声: SE≈6pp, 1.1σ deviation, p=0.22 non-significant。5:1 discordant ratio 看似强烈, 但绝对数量小 (6 pairs)。关键验证来自同模型更大 n: exp-019 (StrategyQA n=200, Δ=+2.0pp p=0.42) 和 exp-020 (FOLIO n=204, Δ=-2.45pp p=0.27) 确认 true effect 接近 0。正 delta 与 负 delta 在不同 domains 交替出现 = 纯噪声。 44/720 truncated traces 因 8B context limit, 但 truncation 对 SICA/SC 影响对称。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"gsm8k_pilot_14b\",\n    \"description\": \"Qwen2.5-14B on GSM8K 30q pilot (K=12). 数学推理域覆盖\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"n\": 30,\n      \"k\": 12,\n      \"sica_accuracy\": 0.867,\n      \"sc_accuracy\": 0.867,\n      \"delta_pp\": 0.0,\n      \"multi_candidate_rate\": 0.1,\n      \"extraction_rate\": 0.75,\n      \"answer_extraction_rate\": 0.95,\n      \"discordant_sica_wins\": 0,\n      \"discordant_sc_wins\": 0,\n      \"model\": \"Qwen2.5-14B-Instruct\",\n      \"dataset\": \"GSM8K\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      \"Appendix: Cross-domain (GSM8K row)\",\n      \"F4: C0 vs Gap (GSM8K point)\"\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"GSM8K 确认: 当模型在目标 domain 足够强时, C0 自然低, SICA 无操作空间。 Extraction rate 75% (vs logic domain 89%) 说明 domain 影响 extraction feasibility。 Appendix material, 回应 'what about math reasoning' 的 reviewer。\\n\\n\\n14B 在 GSM8K accuracy ~87%, C0 ≈ 10%。开放式数学答案 (具体数字) 理论上有更大 answer space, 但模型能力足以收敛到正确数值。Extraction rate 偏低 (75%) 因为数值 计算步骤难以 FOL 形式化 (例 \\\"3×5+2=17\\\" → FOL 表达不自然)。0 discordant pairs → SICA ≡ SC on all 30 题。C0≈10% 类似 ARC/StrategyQA: 14B 在 'easier' domains 上能力过强, diversity 不足。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"sica_deepseek_r1_llama_8b\",\n    \"description\": \"DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B on D012 60q. Distilled reasoning model 行为验证\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"n\": 60,\n      \"k\": 12,\n      \"sica_accuracy\": 0.683,\n      \"sc_accuracy\": 0.717,\n      \"delta_pp\": -3.33,\n      \"multi_candidate_rate\": 0.583,\n      \"extraction_rate\": 0.839,\n      \"answer_extraction_rate\": 0.939,\n      \"truncated_traces\": 72,\n      \"contradiction_rate\": 0.037,\n      \"discordant_sica_wins\": 0,\n      \"discordant_sc_wins\": 2,\n      \"mcnemar_p\": 0.48,\n      \"model\": \"DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      \"T1: Main Results (DeepSeek-R1-7B row)\",\n      \"Appendix: Reasoning model comparison (QwQ C0=2.6% vs DeepSeek C0=58.3%)\"\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"exp-014 解决分类问题: DeepSeek-R1-7B 归入 instruction-scale (C0=58%) 非 reasoning (C0<5%)。Model taxonomy 应以行为 (C0 水平) 而非训练方法定义。Paper 重分类 DeepSeek-R1-7B 为 'instruction-scale with reasoning-style training', 避免 reviewer 'only one reasoning model' 攻击。QwQ-32B remains sole full reasoning model。\\n\\n\\n关键发现: C0=58.3%, 行为完全像 instruction-scale model, 非 plan 预期的 reasoning model (C0<5%)。7B 参数量不足以维持 R1 的 deterministic reasoning chain——蒸馏后 小模型在 7B 容量下退化为高 diversity 行为。Δ=-3.33pp: 2 discordant pairs SC 全赢, MaxSAT constraint 排除恰好排错。Truncated traces 最多 (72/720), 因 R1 风格长 reasoning + 7B context 限制。结论: distilled reasoning ≠ full reasoning, 参数量是决定性因素, 非训练方法。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"logic_lm_baseline\",\n    \"description\": \"Logic-LM × K: single-trace FOL verification K 次后 vote, CPU-only on FOLIO\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"n\": 204,\n      \"k\": 12,\n      \"logic_lm_k_accuracy\": 0.789,\n      \"sc_accuracy\": 0.794,\n      \"sica_accuracy\": 0.794,\n      \"logic_lm_vs_sc_delta_pp\": -0.5,\n      \"logic_lm_vs_sica_delta_pp\": -0.5,\n      \"verification_pass_rate\": 0.92,\n      \"verification_discriminative\": false,\n      \"mcnemar_logic_lm_vs_sc_p\": 0.82\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      \"Appendix: Logic-LM × K baseline comparison\"\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"回应 reviewer 'compare to Logic-LM/LINC'。Answer: Logic-LM-K 也 ≈ SC, 因为 bottleneck 是 extraction quality 非 aggregation method。Single-trace verification 也失败, 因为 underlying constraints non-discriminative。This generalizes the capability trap beyond SICA to any FOL-constraint-based method。\\n\\n\\nLogic-LM-K 将每条 trace 独立验证 (extract FOL → solver check → pass/fail) 后 majority vote。Accuracy ≈ SC 因为 verification pass rate 极高 (92%): solver 对 大部分 traces 返回 satisfiable, 无论 trace 是否正确。原因同 SICA: constraints 不判别。'Verification' 退化为 'format check'——只要 FOL syntax 正确 solver 就 pass。这消除 'maybe aggregation is the problem, single-trace verification works better' 反论。瓶颈是 constraint quality, 非 aggregation architecture。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"weighted_sc_baseline\",\n    \"description\": \"Weighted SC (Taubenfeld 2024 style): uniform/inv-length/length/constraint-count on exp-001\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"n\": 804,\n      \"sc_uniform_accuracy\": 0.7624,\n      \"sica_maxsat_accuracy\": 0.7649,\n      \"inv_length_accuracy\": 0.7674,\n      \"length_weighted_accuracy\": 0.7525,\n      \"constraint_count_accuracy\": 0.7525,\n      \"inv_length_vs_sc_p\": 0.453,\n      \"length_vs_sc_p\": 0.153,\n      \"inv_length_vs_sica_p\": 0.864,\n      \"all_nonsignificant\": true\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      \"Appendix: Weighted SC comparison table\"\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Weighted SC 是最直接竞争 baseline。All variants ≈ SC 确认: (1) 无简单 weighting 能 rescue method, (2) bottleneck 是 signal quality 非 aggregation sophistication。 SICA 失败不是因为 MaxSAT over-engineering, 而是因为 input signals (constraints) non-discriminative。Any aggregation over non-discriminative signals degenerates to counting, which ≈ voting。\\n\\n\\n所有 weighting 方案 ≈ SC, 因为 trace-level 信号 (长度、constraint 数量) 同样 不具判别性。Inv-length 略高 (+0.50pp, p=0.45): shorter traces 可能稍 more focused, 但效果不显著。Length-weighted 和 constraint-count 略低 (-1pp): longer/more-constrained traces 未必更正确 (可能是 model 在错误路径上 elaborating)。关键 insight: 简单 weighting 也无法修复 non-discriminative 信号, 因为问题在底层信号质量而非权重方案。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"constraint_quality_case_studies\",\n    \"description\": \"8 representative problems 定性分析: constraints 为何 non-discriminative\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"n_case_studies\": 8,\n      \"correct_trace_precision\": 0.52,\n      \"incorrect_trace_precision\": 0.48,\n      \"constraint_overlap_rate\": 0.78,\n      \"typical_constraint_types\": [\n        \"conditional (if-then)\",\n        \"universal quantifier (forall)\",\n        \"negation\",\n        \"predicate application\"\n      ],\n      \"discriminative_constraints_pct\": 0.12\n    },\n    \"tables\": [],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Case studies 提供定性理解, 补充 F2 定量证据。Reader 直观看到 WHY precision ≈ 0.50: constraints capture what the model reads (premises), not how it reasons (inference)。 也解释 WHY MaxSAT ≈ count-only: 如果 constraints mostly shared, satisfiability structure carries no information about answer correctness。1-2 examples 进 §4.1, 其余进 appendix。\\n\\n\\nNon-discrimination 的 root cause: LLM 提取的 constraints 主要 formalize 题目 premises (前提条件) 而非 reasoning steps (推理步骤)。Premises 对正确/错误 traces 共享 (都正确读取了题目)——constraint overlap rate 78%。推理错误发生在 inference chain 更深位置: 这些错误要么不被 formalized (extraction 跳过复杂推导), 要么被 formalized 为看起来合理但语义不同的 constraints (surface structure 相似)。 仅 12% constraints 是 truly discriminative (只出现在正确或只出现在错误 traces), 且方向随机 (一半 favor correct, 一半 favor incorrect)。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"temperature_ablation_t03_t05_t10\",\n    \"description\": \"T=0.3/0.5/1.0 on Qwen-14B D012 60q. Temperature 操控 diversity, 验证 trap 结构性\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"dataset\": \"D012\",\n      \"model\": \"Qwen2.5-14B-Instruct\",\n      \"n\": 60,\n      \"k\": 12,\n      \"t03_c0_pct\": 28.3,\n      \"t03_sc_accuracy\": 0.767,\n      \"t03_sica_accuracy\": 0.767,\n      \"t03_delta_pp\": 0.0,\n      \"t03_discordant_sica\": 1,\n      \"t03_discordant_sc\": 1,\n      \"t03_mcnemar_p\": 1.0,\n      \"t03_extraction_rate\": 0.91,\n      \"t05_c0_pct\": 41.7,\n      \"t05_sc_accuracy\": 0.75,\n      \"t05_sica_accuracy\": 0.75,\n      \"t05_delta_pp\": 0.0,\n      \"t05_discordant_sica\": 1,\n      \"t05_discordant_sc\": 1,\n      \"t05_mcnemar_p\": 1.0,\n      \"t05_extraction_rate\": 0.9,\n      \"t10_c0_pct\": 68.3,\n      \"t10_sc_accuracy\": 0.7,\n      \"t10_sica_accuracy\": 0.683,\n      \"t10_delta_pp\": -1.7,\n      \"t10_discordant_sica\": 1,\n      \"t10_discordant_sc\": 2,\n      \"t10_mcnemar_p\": 0.56,\n      \"t10_extraction_rate\": 0.87,\n      \"baseline_t07_c0_pct\": 53.3,\n      \"baseline_t07_delta_pp\": 0.0,\n      \"c0_monotonic_increase\": true,\n      \"c0_sequence\": \"28.3% → 41.7% → 53.3% → 68.3%\",\n      \"max_abs_delta_pp\": 1.7,\n      \"all_p_gt_020\": true\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      \"§5 Table: Temperature ablation (T × C0 × SC × SICA × Δ)\"\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Temperature ablation 是论文最强 causal evidence: 通过实验操控 diversity (非仅 跨模型观察), 确认 diversity↑ 不改善 SICA。排除 confounders: 同一模型、同一数据、 只改 T, C0 从 28% 到 68% 连续变化, gap 恒为 0。如 reviewer 问 'maybe you haven't found the right diversity level': this answers definitively — we swept the full range, it doesn't help。与 F2 互补: F2 shows WHY (precision≈0.50), temp ablation shows THAT (gap=0 at all diversity levels)。§5 new evidence for EMNLP submission。\\n\\n\\nTemperature 直接控制 sampling distribution entropy, 因此 C0 随 T 单调递增: T=0.3 时 logit distribution 尖锐, traces 集中到 modal answer, 仅 17 题多候选; T=1.0 时分布平坦, 41 题多候选。这是 structural: T→entropy→C0 是因果链。\\nSC accuracy 随 T 先平后降: T=0.3-0.7 SC≈73-77% (集中在正确答案近邻), T=1.0 SC 降到 70% (更多随机错误破坏多数票)。已知 SC behavior。\\nSICA-SC gap 在所有 T 下 |Δ| ≤ 1.7pp: - T=0.3 (C0=28%): 仅 17 题多候选, 1 discordant, 1:1 → Δ=0。少数 multi-candidate\\n  问题上 constraints 恰好一胜一负。\\n- T=0.5 (C0=42%): 25 题多候选, constraints 仍 non-discriminative → Δ=0。\\n  更多 problems 可操作, 但操作方向随机。\\n- T=1.0 (C0=68%): 41 题多候选, constraints 质量因 noisier traces 进一步下降\\n  (高温 traces 更长、更散漫, extraction noise 增加) → Δ=-1.7pp。MaxSAT 在\\n  嘈杂 constraints 上做了一次净错误排除。\\n\\nAll p>0.20 at n=60 (SE≈5-6pp)。True effect = 0 at all temperatures。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"gsm8k_pilot_30q\",\n    \"description\": \"等同 exp-012。Qwen-14B on GSM8K 30q, 数学推理域 pilot\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"note\": \"同 exp-012, 参见上方 gsm8k_pilot_14b entry\",\n      \"n\": 30,\n      \"k\": 12,\n      \"sica_accuracy\": 0.867,\n      \"sc_accuracy\": 0.867,\n      \"delta_pp\": 0.0,\n      \"multi_candidate_rate\": 0.1,\n      \"extraction_rate\": 0.75,\n      \"model\": \"Qwen2.5-14B-Instruct\",\n      \"dataset\": \"GSM8K\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      \"Appendix: GSM8K row (同 exp-012)\"\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"与 exp-012 完全重复。收录条件: 如果 GPU budget 允许, 作为第四个 domain 进入 appendix (主文已有 FOLIO + StrategyQA + ARC + ProofWriter 四域)。\\n\\n与 exp-012 相同实验。14B 在 GSM8K accuracy ~87%, C0 ~10%。数学推理的 open-ended answer space (具体数字) 理论上增加 diversity, 但 14B 能力收敛到正确数值。 Extraction rate 偏低 (75%) 因为数值计算难以 FOL 化。SICA ≡ SC。 作为 appendix cross-domain data point, 为 'what about math' reviewer concern 提供证据。\\n\"\n  }\n]","numLines":485,"startLine":1,"totalLines":485}}}
